      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom mid-terrace home to the market, ideally positioned in the heart of the mature and highly sought-after residential area of Cabra, Dublin 7. No. 88 comes to the market in good condition throughout and benefits from vacant possession, making it an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated within easy reach of a host of local amenities including schools, shops, cafés, parks and sporting facilities. Dublin City Centre is easily accessible, while the area is very well serviced by public transport and offers excellent connectivity to the surrounding road network.\n\nBright and well laid out internal living accommodation of c. 67 sq.m. comprises of entrance hallway, spacious living room with feature fireplace, fitted kitchen with electric cooker, downstairs WC, two well-proportioned double bedrooms and a fully tiled main bathroom complete with WC, WHB and bath with shower.\n\nNo. 88 comes to the market in good condition throughout having been well maintained over the years and offers bright accommodation with plenty of potential for its new owner to put their own stamp on the property. Additional benefits include gas fired central heating, fitted wardrobes and a driveway to the front providing off-street parking along with further on-street parking.\n\nOne of the standout features of No. 88 is the long and beautifully maintained rear garden, complete with lawn, mature planting and a block-built shed to the rear, providing excellent outdoor and storage space.\n\nThis is an ideal opportunity for any buyer seeking a well-proportioned home with generous outdoor space in a mature and established Dublin 7 location. Early viewing is highly advised, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 832 3302 or 01 541 1455 to arrange a viewing.\n \nKey Features\n• c. 67 sq.m.\n• BER D\n• Vacant possession\n• Good condition throughout\n• Bright and well-proportioned accommodation\n• Two double bedrooms\n• Downstairs WC\n• Fully tiled main bathroom\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Fitted wardrobes\n• Driveway with off-street parking\n• Further on-street parking\n• Long, well-maintained rear garden\n• Block-built shed to rear\n• Mature and sought-after residential area\n• Excellent location in Cabra, Dublin 7\n• Easy access to Dublin City Centre\n• Ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers and investors\n• Early viewing highly advised\n \nDirections D07 H2V9"
      },
      {
